# Each app reads its own env file. The examples live beside each app, so copy
# those rather than this one:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example    → apps/api/.env
#   apps/web/.env.example    → apps/web/.env.local
#   apps/mobile/.env.example → apps/mobile/.env
#
# `npx supabase status` prints the service role key the API needs; the API also
# needs BETTER_AUTH_SECRET (any 32+ random characters). Setup steps are in
# README.md, and APP_ENV / LOG_LEVEL / the Sentry DSNs are explained in
# docs/error-handling.md.
